  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes a hybrid frequency-domain enhanced bi-directional recurrent quantum network (FDBRQ) for stock trend prediction using 6 qubits and an Ansatz depth of 3. On the 1-step task, it reports RMSE/MAE/MAPE of 0.2174/0.1448/0.3941, 0.2065/0.1615/0.5153, 8.0272/6.3208/0.3510, and 0.3971/0.2295/0.4749 across the four CSI 300 stocks; on the 5-step task, the corresponding values are 0.5039/0.3874/1.0522, 0.4270/0.3384/1.0715, 20.3476/15.1537/0.8404, and 0.7021/0.5272/1.0837.",
